"The receiving Mac must select Allow unless seamless control is enabled there." = "除非接收端已啟用無縫控制，否則仍必須選取「允許」。";
"Press Control-Option-Command-Escape to interrupt sharing and return the keyboard and mouse to this Mac." = "按下 Control-Option-Command-Escape 可中斷分享，將鍵盤與滑鼠交還給這台 Mac。";
"Press Control-Option-Command-Escape to interrupt sharing and return the keyboard, mouse, and trackpad to this Mac." = "按下 Control-Option-Command-Escape 可中斷分享，將鍵盤、滑鼠與觸控板交還給這台 Mac。";
"This switches the display, then shares the keyboard and mouse. Press Control-Option-Command-Escape to interrupt and return them to this Mac." = "這會先切換螢幕，再分享鍵盤與滑鼠。按下 Control-Option-Command-Escape 可中斷並將它們交還給這台 Mac。";
"This switches the display, then shares the keyboard, mouse, and trackpad. Press Control-Option-Command-Escape to interrupt and return them to this Mac." = "這會先切換螢幕，再分享鍵盤、滑鼠與觸控板。按下 Control-Option-Command-Escape 可中斷並將它們交還給這台 Mac。";
"After manually selecting the monitor input, Control-Option-Command-K switches keyboard/mouse control. Control-Option-Command-O automatically switches the display first and then transfers keyboard/mouse ownership. Escape is the emergency local-return shortcut." = "手動選擇螢幕輸入後，Control-Option-Command-K 可切換鍵盤／滑鼠控制；Control-Option-Command-O 會自動先切換螢幕，再交接鍵盤／滑鼠控制權。Escape 是緊急交還本機的快捷鍵。";
"After manually selecting the monitor input, Control-Option-Command-K switches keyboard, mouse, and trackpad control. Control-Option-Command-O automatically switches the display first and then transfers input ownership. Escape is the emergency local-return shortcut." = "手動選擇螢幕輸入後，Control-Option-Command-K 可切換鍵盤、滑鼠與觸控板控制；Control-Option-Command-O 會自動先切換螢幕，再交接輸入控制權。Escape 是緊急交還本機的快捷鍵。";
"This switches the display, then shares the keyboard and mouse. Control-Option-Command-O performs the same automatic toggle; press it again from the other device to return the display and input. If you switched the monitor input manually, use Control-Option-Command-K to change keyboard/mouse control. Control-Option-Command-Escape interrupts and returns them to this Mac." = "這會先切換螢幕，再分享鍵盤與滑鼠。Control-Option-Command-O 會執行相同的自動切換；從另一台裝置再按一次可恢復螢幕與輸入。若你已手動切換螢幕輸入，請用 Control-Option-Command-K 切換鍵盤／滑鼠控制；Control-Option-Command-Escape 可中斷並將它們交還給這台 Mac。";
"This switches the display, then shares the keyboard, mouse, and trackpad. Control-Option-Command-O performs the same automatic toggle; press it again from the other device to return the display and input. If you switched the monitor input manually, use Control-Option-Command-K to change keyboard, mouse, and trackpad control. Control-Option-Command-Escape interrupts and returns them to this Mac." = "這會先切換螢幕，再分享鍵盤、滑鼠與觸控板。Control-Option-Command-O 會執行相同的自動切換；從另一台裝置再按一次可恢復螢幕與輸入。若你已手動切換螢幕輸入，請用 Control-Option-Command-K 切換鍵盤、滑鼠與觸控板控制；Control-Option-Command-Escape 可中斷並將它們交還給這台 Mac。";
